**Implement upload cancellation in <code>handleRemoveFile</code> using <code>AbortController</code> to stop <br>in-progress network requests when a user removes a file, thus saving network <br>resources.**

[apps/studio.giselles.ai/app/(main)/playground/page.client.tsx [515-517]]([URL]

